  "priorExpiration": "1996-06-25",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ed 602.03 Demonstrated Competencies. To promote the learning of all NH students, each PEPP shall require every graduate of the PEPP to demonstrate evidence of the competencies in Ed 607 and relevant sections of Ed 608 at the level of a beginning educator within each endorsement area.\n\nSource. #2055, eff 6-16-82; ss by #2714, eff 5-16-84, EXPIRED 5-16-90\n\nNew. #4851, eff 6-25-90; EXPIRED 6-25-96\n\nNew. #6366, eff 10-30-96; ss and moved by #8194, eff 10-26-04 (formerly Ed 602.02); ss by #10295, eff 3-22-13; ss by #13747, eff 9-16-23",
